Needs a live SurrealDB: the `surrealdb` datasource connects to the `surrealdb`
composer service (cbor://root:root@surrealdb:8000), which the macOS CI runner
can't start, so the first page fails to mount (`table article couldn't be
opened`) and the shared "clean startup" scenario fails. Run it explicitly with
the service up and seeded (tests/schema.surql, tests/seed.surql):
`cargo run -p test-framework -- apps/real-world`.
